WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:09.330
Pay what is due by card, mobile wallet or at a payment outlet, and get your receipt straight away.

2
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:14.510
When something is due, the home page of your portal says so.

3
00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:18.110
Your balance shows what is due now.

4
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:21.170
Choose Pay now.

5
00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:27.730
The invoice shows what it is for, the due date and what is still outstanding.

6
00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:36.380
Choose how to pay: a bank card, a mobile wallet, or cash at a payment outlet with a reference number.

7
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:41.890
Pay. You go to the secure payment page of the bank.

8
00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:51.670
Check the amount and the invoice, then confirm. In this practice office the bank page is a test page, so no money moves.

9
00:00:54.460 --> 00:01:00.630
Payment received. The receipt number is here, and a copy goes to your email.

10
00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:08.480
Back in the portal, the invoice is paid and the receipt is ready to download any time.
